  "ni_class_1_employer": {
   "definition_period": "year",
   "documentation": "Secondary Class 1 contributions at the secondary percentage on earnings above the secondary threshold (SSCBA 1992 s.9). For an earner under 21 (s.9A) or a relevant apprentice under 25 (s.9B), earnings up to the upper secondary threshold, or the apprentice upper secondary threshold, are zero-rated.",
