  },
  "ni_class_2": {
   "definition_period": "year",
   "documentation": "Compulsory Class 2 contributions under s.11(2) SSCBA 1992 for a full year of self-employment: the weekly rate for each contribution week in the tax year (53 in 2019-20, otherwise 52 to 2023-24). Liability is tested on relevant profits, the profits on which Class 4 is payable under s.15 (s.11(3)), as modelled in ni_class_4_profits.",
